"en": "Lesser Fire Crystal"
}
description = "放在法杖的装载槽上：法杖伤害 +{amount}，打出火焰伤害，打中后给对手施加一层【灼伤】。能供给 {max_charges} 场，用完就碎，碎了只能卖钱。"
descriptions = {
"en": "Set it in a staff's loading slot: staff Damage +{amount}, deals Fire damage, and each hit gives the opponent one stack of Burn. Lasts {max_charges} battles, then shatters; a shattered one is only worth selling."
}
